# Asset Category Master Implementation (Updated)

This module models the hierarchical classification of assets (Grandparent → Parent → Child) and introduces the **Identification Rule** for each category to ensure asset numbers are validated correctly upon creation.

## User Review Required

Please review the proposed schema updates below. 

