## Proposed Changes

### 1. Asset Category Schema Updates

#### `src/asset-categories/schemas/asset-category.schema.ts`
We will add a nested `IdentificationRule` schema.

```typescript
export enum IdentificationType {
  NUMERIC = 'NUMERIC',
  ALPHANUMERIC = 'ALPHANUMERIC',
}

@Schema({ _id: false })
export class IdentificationRule {
  @Prop({ type: String, enum: IdentificationType, required: true })
  type: IdentificationType;

  @Prop({ type: Number, required: true })
  length: number;

  @Prop({ type: Boolean, default: false })
  checkDigit: boolean;
}

// In AssetCategory:
@Prop({ type: IdentificationRule, required: false })
identificationRule?: IdentificationRule;
```

### 2. DTO Updates
We will update `CreateAssetCategoryDto` and `UpdateAssetCategoryDto` to include the optional `identificationRule` object, validating its nested properties using `class-validator` (`@ValidateNested`, `Type`).

### 3. Seed Script Updates
We will update `seed-asset-categories.ts` to include the specific `identificationRule` for each relevant category once you provide the exact mapping.

*(Note: The `Asset Validation Service` will be built as part of the actual Asset creation module later, which will consume these rules to validate asset IDs).*
